{"seq":2,"slug":"eligibility-calculation-engine","title":"激励资格认定与优惠额度计算引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sez-investor-incentive-compliance-operations/incentive-eligibility-qualification-engine/eligibility-calculation-engine","wordCount":3021,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"激励资格认定与优惠额度计算引擎\">激励资格认定与优惠额度计算引擎</h1><p>同一家制造企业申请园区优惠，法务在申报表上勾选&quot;符合条件&quot;，系统却给出两个数字：一次性抵免 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Unexpected character: &#x27;\\&#x27; at position 1: \\̲\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">\\</span></span>1{,}200{,}000$ 与分五年计入的租金减免。前者算错一年就是税基跨期错配，后者算错折现率会让整份援助强度超限。资格认定给出布尔值，额度计算给出<strong>一条带时间戳的现金流</strong>——两者必须由同一个可复算的引擎同时产出，否则&quot;合资格但金额错&quot;会让审计无从对账。</p>\n<p>本文处理<strong>资格与额度的计算引擎</strong>，即规则对象落库之后、生成优惠行之前的求值与计量执行层。规则对象的构成见同 hub 的 <a href=\"incentive-policy-taxonomy-rule-model\">激励政策分类与可计算规则模型</a>。本文只回答：给定一份证据快照与一个已定版的规则集，如何<strong>确定性</strong>算出资格布尔值与优惠金额序列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一次求值同时产出资格与额度\">核心概念：一次求值同时产出资格与额度</h2><p>核心概念在于<strong>资格与额度是同一次确定性求值的两个并列输出，而非两套系统</strong>。资格是布尔谓词的合取，额度是基数经函数映射后的现金流序列；两者共享同一份证据快照、同一版规则集、同一评估时点。拆成两套系统最典型的故障是&quot;资格系统判合资格、额度系统按旧目录计价&quot;，两个结果各自自洽却互相矛盾，审计时无法对账。引擎因此是一条把证据逐步收缩为金额的管线，分五个阶段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计算引擎的管线-五个不可交换的阶段\">计算引擎的管线：五个不可交换的阶段</h2><p>阶段之间不可交换，因为每一阶段的输出类型不同、失败语义不同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[证据快照&lt;br/&gt;事实 + 时点] --&gt; B[1 匹配: 哪些规则被触发]&#10;  B --&gt; C[2 资格门: 有序谓词求值]&#10;  C --&gt; D{全部通过?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E[结构化拒绝&lt;br/&gt;未满足谓词 + 补正指引]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| F[3 计量: 基数 × 额度函数]&#10;  F --&gt; G[4 约束: 强度上限 · 叠加 · 去最小化]&#10;  G --&gt; H[5 计划: 年度现金流 + 折现 NPV]&#10;  H --&gt; I[优惠行&lt;br/&gt;附规则版本 + 证据快照 ID]\">graph TD\n  A[证据快照&lt;br/&gt;事实 + 时点] --&gt; B[1 匹配: 哪些规则被触发]\n  B --&gt; C[2 资格门: 有序谓词求值]\n  C --&gt; D{全部通过?}\n  D --&gt;|否| E[结构化拒绝&lt;br/&gt;未满足谓词 + 补正指引]\n  D --&gt;|是| F[3 计量: 基数 × 额度函数]\n  F --&gt; G[4 约束: 强度上限 · 叠加 · 去最小化]\n  G --&gt; H[5 计划: 年度现金流 + 折现 NPV]\n  H --&gt; I[优惠行&lt;br/&gt;附规则版本 + 证据快照 ID]</pre><p><strong>匹配</strong>决定进入评估的规则集合，处理&quot;一笔设备采购同时触发关税豁免与投资抵免&quot;这类多命中场景。<strong>资格门</strong>是纯谓词求值，不产生金额。<strong>计量</strong>把合格基数映射成金额。<strong>约束</strong>可削减金额，但<strong>永不提高金额</strong>——这是单调性契约。<strong>计划</strong>把金额铺到时间轴上并折现。把资格门与计量拆开，是为了让失败模式可分辨：资格失败返回拒绝码，计量失败（如基数为负、货币缺失）返回数据错误码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"资格门-有序谓词求值与结构化拒绝\">资格门：有序谓词求值与结构化拒绝</h2><p>资格判定有三种实现风格，选择取决于政策文本的<strong>变动频率</strong>与<strong>可解释性要求</strong>：随政策同步变动的部分必须外置为数据，稳定的工程契约才写进代码。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实现风格</th>\n<th>适用条件</th>\n<th>可解释性</th>\n<th>变动代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>决策表（decision table）</td>\n<td>条件少、枚举清晰、业务方直接维护</td>\n<td>高（命中行即证据）</td>\n<td>改表即生效，无需发版</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则语言 / FEEL 表达式</td>\n<td>条件组合多、需复用与嵌套</td>\n<td>中（需回放求值轨迹）</td>\n<td>改规则文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬编码谓词函数</td>\n<td>判据稳定、与外部系统强耦合</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>每次改动都要发版</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>决策表与规则表达式都源自同一套可判定语义。OMG 的决策模型与标记（DMN）把&quot;输入 → 决策表 → 输出&quot;标准化，其 FEEL 表达式支持无歧义求值（<a href=\"https://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/\">OMG DMN 规范</a>）。这与补贴专向性的合法性判据同源：能被写成封闭客观谓词、且资格自动取得的条件，最不容易被认定为裁量性专向（<a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/docs_e/legal_e/24-scm_01_e.htm\">WTO SCM Agreement 第 2.1(b) 条</a>）。<strong>因此决策表的另一个价值不是工程便利，而是合规举证</strong>——命中哪一行、为什么命中，本身就是可提交的证据。</p>\n<p>求值必须<strong>有序且短路</strong>。顺序由政策依赖决定：主体资格 → 行业目录 → 地域归属 → 规模档位 → 实质运营。规模档位（中小企业判定）被后续强度上浮引用，必须早于金额阶段确定。谓词结果是三值而非二值：真、假、<strong>未知</strong>（证据缺失）。未知不得当假——把&quot;未提交社保记录&quot;判成&quot;不合资格&quot;会误拒合格申请人，正确做法是挂起并生成补正任务。</p>\n<p>拒绝输出必须是结构化清单，而非一句失败文案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;decision_id&quot;: &quot;dec-2026-000871&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rule_version&quot;: &quot;cit-pref-15-encouraged@2026.01&quot;,&#10;  &quot;eligible&quot;: false,&#10;  &quot;failed_predicates&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;field&quot;: &quot;substantive_operation&quot;,&#10;      &quot;rule&quot;: &quot;substance_test_v3&quot;,&#10;      &quot;result&quot;: &quot;unknown&quot;,&#10;      &quot;evidence&quot;: &quot;missing:social_security_12m&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"decision_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dec-2026-000871\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rule_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cit-pref-15-encouraged@2026.01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"eligible\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"failed_predicates\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"substantive_operation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"substance_test_v3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"result\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"unknown\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"missing:social_security_12m\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"计量基数-合格支出-增量口径与池化\">计量基数：合格支出、增量口径与池化</h2><p>额度的分母是<strong>合格基数</strong>，分母选错会让所有优惠率失效。同一笔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Unexpected character: &#x27;\\&#x27; at position 1: \\̲\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">\\</span></span>5{,}000{,}000$ 设备投资，按&quot;总额口径&quot;与&quot;增量口径&quot;计出的基数可能相差数倍。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Base</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>baseline</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Base} = \\max\\!\\big(0,\\; I_{\\text{new}} - \\lambda \\cdot I_{\\text{baseline}}\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Base</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">baseline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{\\text{new}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为申报期合格支出，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>baseline</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{\\text{baseline}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">baseline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为基准期同类支出，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\in \\{0, 1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 即总额口径，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 即增量口径。增量口径防止&quot;把既有产能搬进园区套取优惠&quot;，与合规层的&quot;不得关闭同类活动&quot;条款相呼应。</p>\n<p>基数可判定性依赖<strong>资产分类映射</strong>：设备、软件、厂房改建、研发人力各归入哪一档合格类别，决定它能否进基数与折旧年限。引擎不应内嵌分类逻辑，而应查一张<strong>分类映射表</strong>（政策目录的机器可读副本），因目录随年度调整。池化把多期小额支出按同一合格类别聚合成一个基数，但<strong>聚合不得跨越货币</strong>——混合币种须按归属日汇率折算并留存汇率来源，否则基数不可复算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"额度函数与年度现金流计划\">额度函数与年度现金流计划</h2><p>金额计算是&quot;基数 × 额度函数&quot;，再逐年铺开。四类工具的计量函数形态不同：税率式减少率、扣减式缩税基、抵免式减税额、补贴式是直接金额。它们在引擎里应实现为<strong>同一签名的纯函数</strong>：<code>(base, params, period) -&gt; amount</code>，这样约束层与计划层不必按工具类别分支。</p>\n<p>计划层把一次性金额拆成时间序列，并折现为净现值。这是&quot;账面优惠&quot;与&quot;实际到手价值&quot;分离的地方——分五年计入的租金减免，净现值远低于名义总额：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>NPV</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><mfrac><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>Base</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>cap</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{NPV} = \\sum_{t=0}^{T} \\frac{B_t}{(1+d)^{t}},\\qquad B_t = \\min\\!\\big(f(\\text{Base}_t),\\ \\text{cap}_t\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NPV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7196em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Base</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 年计入的优惠额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>cap</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cap}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6747em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为该年度上限，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 为折现率。折现率不得由业务随意填写，须取自监管发布的参考利率：欧盟竞争政策口径以基准利率加风险边际构成参考与折现率，并以 €STR 等无风险利率取代已退场的 IBOR 系列（<a href=\"https://competition-policy.ec.europa.eu/state-aid/reference-and-discount-rates_en\">EU reference and discount rates</a>）。</p>\n<p>跨期优惠必须处理<strong>年度比例分摊</strong>。优惠期从年中某日生效时，首年额度按窗口覆盖天数折算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>year</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>AnnualCap</mtext><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>days</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mtext>days</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\text{year}} = \\text{AnnualCap}\\times\\frac{\\text{days}(W \\cap Y)}{\\text{days}(Y)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">year</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AnnualCap</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">days</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">days</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>窗口末年的投资须按业务发生时间归属而非录入时间，否则会被错误算进或排除出优惠期。税率式优惠可参照海南自由贸易港：企业所得税按 15% 计征（标准 25%），人才个税超 15% 部分免征，政策延续至 2027 年（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hainan_Free_Trade_Port\">Hainan Free Trade Port</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"约束层-强度上限-叠加与去最小化\">约束层：强度上限、叠加与去最小化</h2><p>单一激励合规不保证组合合规。约束层按三个层次削减：同一税种内、跨税种、税式与现金补贴之间。<strong>强度上限</strong>把优惠折算为对合格成本的净现值比率，是组合合规的主闸门：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mtext>NPV</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>benefit</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mtext>NPV</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>eligible cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>g</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_{\\text{total}} = \\sum_{i \\in S} \\frac{\\text{NPV}(\\text{benefit}_i)}{\\text{NPV}(\\text{eligible cost})} \\le \\bar{g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7487em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NPV</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eligible cost</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NPV</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">benefit</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7622em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>欧盟区域投资援助框架是这一结构的代表：区域援助须满足按区域类别设定的最高强度，中小企业可上浮（小型加 20 个百分点、中型加 10 个百分点），超过通报门槛则须事前通报（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2014/651/oj/eng\">Reg. (EU) No 651/2014 第 14 条</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>叠加规则</strong>用&quot;互斥组&quot;表达：同一组内只能取一（如两种企业所得税优惠率），跨组可叠加但受强度上限约束。<strong>去最小化门槛</strong>是独立通道——低于门槛的小额援助无须通报，但<strong>须按单一企业、三年滚动窗口累计</strong>，而非按单笔交易判断。全欧通用去最小化上限已由 Reg. (EU) 2023/2831 提高至每企业三年 €300,000（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/2831/oj/eng\">Reg. (EU) 2023/2831</a>）。</p>\n<p>约束层的工程要点是<strong>削减顺序确定</strong>：先套互斥组（决定哪些优惠共存），再算强度上限（削减超标部分），最后核去最小化累计。顺序颠倒会让去最小化累计被已削减金额污染，导致三年窗口账面失真。</p>\n<p>全球最低税给约束层增加外部天花板：达标跨国集团在某辖区有效税率低于 15% 时，母国可征补足税，使当地优惠被上游回收（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Global_minimum_corporate_tax_rate\">Global minimum corporate tax rate</a>）。引擎须把补足税作为下游扣除项建模，否则&quot;约束后净收益&quot;系统性高估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"确定性-版本化与可复算\">确定性、版本化与可复算</h2><p>审计要的不是&quot;算对了&quot;，而是&quot;能重算出同一个数&quot;。这要求三条契约。</p>\n<p><strong>确定性</strong>：相同输入（事实快照 + 规则版本 + 评估时点）必然得到相同输出。因此禁止引擎读取当前时间、随机数、环境变量或实时汇率——这些属于输入，须由调用方在快照时注入；同一快照重跑不得产生新的优惠行副本。</p>\n<p><strong>十进制运算</strong>：金额禁用 IEEE 754 浮点。二进制浮点无法精确表示 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Unexpected character: &#x27;\\&#x27; at position 1: \\̲\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">\\</span></span>0.1$，多期求和的舍入误差会在多年计划里累积成可见差额。金额一律用十进制类型，按 ISO 4217 币种保留其最小单位，并明确舍入模式（金融场景通常用银行家舍入 <code>half-even</code>）。舍入只在<strong>最终落账时执行一次</strong>，中间过程保留全精度。</p>\n<p><strong>版本化</strong>：规则版本与证据快照 ID 必须与优惠行一同入档。判定发生时用的是哪一版谓词、哪一版目录、哪些事实，三者缺一，事后无法复现。当规则升级，系统须能对存量优惠执行<strong>重算对账</strong>：以同一快照跑新旧两版规则，输出差额，据以生成补缴或补发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测试与对账-黄金用例与边界\">测试与对账：黄金用例与边界</h2><p>计算引擎的缺陷几乎都藏在边界。测试须显式覆盖三类。<strong>阈值邻域</strong>：强度上限、去最小化门槛、规模档位分界都是硬阈值，须构造 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>g</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{g}-\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>g</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{g}+\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 成对用例。<strong>口径不变量</strong>：增量口径在基准期支出为零时应退化为总额口径，宜用属性测试穷举。<strong>跨期边界</strong>：优惠期起始日、闰年、窗口末年重叠，须用固定日期表驱动。</p>\n<p>对账把引擎输出与外部事实交叉验证：优惠行金额之和须等于申报表，去最小化三年累计须等于台账，NPV 须可用独立折现公式复算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>计算引擎是五阶段管线：匹配 → 资格门 → 计量 → 约束 → 计划；阶段不可交换。</li>\n<li>资格门用决策表或规则表达式实现，求值有序短路、结果为三值；结构化拒绝清单本身是可提交的合规证据（对应 WTO SCM 第 2.1(b) 条）。</li>\n<li>基数的总额/增量口径由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 切换；资产分类与币种折算须查表并留存来源。</li>\n<li>金额是&quot;基数 × 额度函数&quot;，计划层用折现率把名义优惠折算为净现值；折现率取自监管参考利率，跨期额度按天数比例分摊。</li>\n<li>约束层顺序固定：先互斥组、再强度上限、最后去最小化三年累计；补足税作为下游扣除项。</li>\n<li>确定性、十进制运算、规则版本与快照同档，是&quot;可复算&quot;的三条硬契约。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"激励资格认定与优惠额度计算引擎","id":"激励资格认定与优惠额度计算引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一次求值同时产出资格与额度","id":"核心概念-一次求值同时产出资格与额度"},{"level":2,"text":"计算引擎的管线：五个不可交换的阶段","id":"计算引擎的管线-五个不可交换的阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"资格门：有序谓词求值与结构化拒绝","id":"资格门-有序谓词求值与结构化拒绝"},{"level":2,"text":"计量基数：合格支出、增量口径与池化","id":"计量基数-合格支出-增量口径与池化"},{"level":2,"text":"额度函数与年度现金流计划","id":"额度函数与年度现金流计划"},{"level":2,"text":"约束层：强度上限、叠加与去最小化","id":"约束层-强度上限-叠加与去最小化"},{"level":2,"text":"确定性、版本化与可复算","id":"确定性-版本化与可复算"},{"level":2,"text":"测试与对账：黄金用例与边界","id":"测试与对账-黄金用例与边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"激励政策分类与可计算规则模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sez-investor-incentive-compliance-operations/incentive-eligibility-qualification-engine/incentive-policy-taxonomy-rule-model"},"next":{"title":"激励申请、审批与兑现拨付流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/sez-investor-incentive-compliance-operations/incentive-eligibility-qualification-engine/incentive-application-approval-disbursement"}}